      "output": "Logit Score to Calibrated Default Probability Mapping:\nz= -4.0 | Prob=0.0180 | Odds= 0.0183 | Slope=0.0177\nz= -2.0 | Prob=0.1192 | Odds= 0.1353 | Slope=0.1050\nz= -0.5 | Prob=0.3775 | Odds= 0.6065 | Slope=0.2350\nz=  0.0 | Prob=0.5000 | Odds= 1.0000 | Slope=0.2500\nz=  0.5 | Prob=0.6225 | Odds= 1.6487 | Slope=0.2350\nz=  2.0 | Prob=0.8808 | Odds= 7.3891 | Slope=0.1050\nz=  4.0 | Prob=0.9820 | Odds=54.5982 | Slope=0.0177"
