      "output": "Executive Dashboard Spatial Layout & F-Pattern Audit:\n======================================================================\nCanvas Resolution: 1920x1080 | Total Widgets Positioned: 5\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\nSTATUS: 100% COMPLIANT WITH F-PATTERN HIERARCHY & 5-SECOND RULE!\n  - Zone 1 (Top-Left): Critical Headline KPIs positioned for immediate fixation.\n  - Zone 2 (Top-Right): Macro trend line providing 12-month context.\n  - Zone 3 (Mid): Categorical segmentation breakdowns.\n  - Zone 4 (Bottom): Detailed root-cause tabular records.\n======================================================================"
