      "output": "Stationarity Transformation & Volatility Stabilization Analysis:\n===========================================================================\nTransformation Type        | Length   | Variance Ratio   | Stationarity Class\n---------------------------------------------------------------------------\nRaw Series (Level)         | N=60     |         2.44x   | Non-Stationary I(1)\nLinear Detrended           | N=60     |         2.61x   | Non-Stationary (Expanding Variance)\nFirst-Differenced (Delta)  | N=59     |         1.85x   | Stationary Mean I(0)\nLog-Differenced (Return)   | N=59     |         1.01x   | Certified Stationary I(0)\n===========================================================================\nConclusion: Log-differencing achieves optimal mean-stationarity and variance homoskedasticity."
