      "output": "ARIMA(1, 1, 1) Simulation & Forward Integration Results:\n===========================================================================\nModel Specification : (1 - 0.60*L) * (1 - L) * Y_t = 0.80 + (1 - 0.35*L) * e_t\nSample History Size : N=60 Months | Final Level: $223.73k\n---------------------------------------------------------------------------\nForward Out-of-Sample Projections (Next 5 Months):\nHorizon (h)    | Forecast Diff (Delta Y)    | Projected Revenue Level\n---------------------------------------------------------------------------\nMonth t+1        | $      2.38k growth/month      | $      226.12k\nMonth t+2        | $      2.23k growth/month      | $      228.35k\nMonth t+3        | $      2.14k growth/month      | $      230.49k\nMonth t+4        | $      2.08k growth/month      | $      232.57k\nMonth t+5        | $      2.05k growth/month      | $      234.62k\n===========================================================================\nProjected 5-Month Net Expansion: +$10.89k"
